            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New in 2.7.1</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Fixed leaving a device stuck on &ldquo;Connecting&hellip;&rdquo; when the account check couldn&rsquo;t finish</strong> &mdash; When this Mac could not confirm that a device belongs to your account &mdash; usually because its own internet connection was struggling &mdash; that device was left waiting with nothing to go on until it gave up minutes later. It now hears what happened straight away, and can retry or pair with a PIN instead.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
